      "side": 1,
      "message": "Seems like we\u0027re eventually going to need some way to gate this feature, for Android rollout? (eg, Android is going to want to expose this in a way that\u0027s dependent on the targeted API version, or similar?). So if you\u0027re developing on a newer device, but want to write code that works on older phones, we\u0027ll need to be able to properly reject mesh code with uniform shaders?",
      "revId": "6f99ba54b5fe91204aaef8713c3e6ff90552313e",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
